<!doctype lake><title>🕵️ 𝓟𝓸𝓼𝓲𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="J2MYW" id="J2MYW" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u1eafd635" id="u1eafd635">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="u95ff7240" id="u95ff7240"> 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠-𝐅𝐫𝐞𝐞 𝐋𝐨𝐧𝐠-𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐱𝐭 𝐒𝐜𝐚𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐨𝐟 𝐋𝐚𝐫𝐠𝐞 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ue36c9180" id="ue36c9180"><strong><span data-lake-id="uecf38212" id="uecf38212">近期研究表明，通过在长文本序列上进一步训练短上下文模型，可以提升模型的长上下文处理能力</span></strong></p><ul list="ufdb261a0"><li fid="u834a6198" data-lake-id="uec723eb4" id="uec723eb4"><span data-lake-id="u1143c051" id="u1143c051">Llama2 Long 采用长文本数据与原始 Llama2 预训练语料的混合数据进行训练，其优异表现充分验证这一方法的有效性。然而，由于这些训练语料难以获取，且长上下文微调的成本高昂，现有开源模型的性能往往逊于专有模型，同时通常仅提供较小规模的版本</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u216b7c4e" id="u216b7c4e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u95547f58" id="u95547f58">在这些约束下，无需额外训练即可扩展大语言模型上下文的方法尤具吸引力。近期提出的免训练方法，包括 LM-Infinite 和 StreamingLLM，表明在有限上下文窗口上训练的 LLMs 也能够高效处理无限长度的文本</span></strong></p><ul list="ufdb261a0" start="2"><li fid="u834a6198" data-lake-id="u01ea9e5e" id="u01ea9e5e"><span data-lake-id="uae24983f" id="uae24983f">这些方法假定 LLMs 无法泛化至超出训练长度的文本，因此通过选择性地保留关键局部信息来处理更长的序列。这类方法能够有效维持较低的困惑度，但会丢失长程依赖关系</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uda7aed65" id="uda7aed65"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9a4d44b3" id="u9a4d44b3">为保留全局信息，另一条研究路径是使模型有效外推至超出训练阶段所见长度的序列</span></strong></p><ul list="u616d0377"><li fid="uc2ba8cdf" data-lake-id="u3502b93d" id="u3502b93d"><span data-lake-id="u5b8e8292" id="u5b8e8292">针对 Llama 系列模型的常用技术，包括位置插值和 NTK-Aware RoPE（NTK），均是对旋转位置编码的改进。与原始 RoPE 相比，这些经过缩放的位置编码所需的微调步数更少，其训练成本还可以通过 YaRN 和 CLEX 等方法进一步降低。在不进行训练的情况下，这些方法通常会导致 PPL 显著升高，尤其当输入长度超过训练长度的两倍时更为明显</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9edb8161" id="u9edb8161"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8e89e53b" id="u8e89e53b" style="color: #DF2A3F">本文提出双分块注意力（Dual Chunk Attention，DCA），这是一种用于大语言模型上下文窗口外推的新型免训练框架</span></strong></p><ul list="u7ff525c0"><li fid="uf57127a9" data-lake-id="ua13de0f0" id="ua13de0f0"><span data-lake-id="ud42dbb50" id="ud42dbb50">既不对位置索引进行线性缩小，也不增大 RoPE 中的基频，而是复用预训练模型原有的位置索引及其对应的嵌入，同时重新设计相对位置矩阵的构造方式，以尽可能忠实、准确地表征两个 token 之间的相对位置</span></li><li fid="uf57127a9" data-lake-id="uf06c31cd" id="uf06c31cd"><span data-lake-id="ueb08bae1" id="ueb08bae1">受高效分块注意力模式的启发，DCA 将长序列的自注意力计算划分为若干小块，每个块的长度均小于预训练上下文窗口的大小</span></li><li fid="uf57127a9" data-lake-id="u42f55e53" id="u42f55e53"><span data-lake-id="u22533446" id="u22533446">DCA 包含三个组成部分：（1）块内注意力，用于处理同一块内的 token；（2）块间注意力，用于处理不同块之间的 token；（3）相邻块注意力，用于处理相邻且不同的块之间的 token。这些针对性的处理方式有助于模型有效捕获序列中的长程依赖与短程依赖</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u62b01466" id="u62b01466"><strong><span data-lake-id="u312c114a" id="u312c114a">外推能力。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u473bf5e9" id="u473bf5e9">在语言建模任务上，DCA 为免训练方法带来显著进展。它首次表明，无需训练即可将 LLMs 的上下文窗口从 4k 扩展至超过 32k，同时使 PPL 的增幅保持在可忽略的水平</span></p><p data-lake-id="u5e40d75b" id="u5e40d75b"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufdfe7286" id="ufdfe7286">正交性。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4c093757" id="u4c093757">DCA 与现有常用的位置编码缩放方法具有正交性，例如 PI 和 NTK。实验表明，原本已支持 32k 上下文窗口的长上下文 LLMs，可以进一步外推至 192k 的上下文长度，同时保持较高的密钥检索准确率和较低的困惑度</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="WSJbw" id="WSJbw" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u18187395" id="u18187395">🐿️</span><span data-lake-id="ud65c9a97" id="ud65c9a97"> 𝐃𝐮𝐚𝐥 𝐂𝐡𝐮𝐧𝐤 𝐀𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u49d7343d" id="u49d7343d"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue87fc137" id="ue87fc137">块内注意力模式实际上相当于在块边界处截断左侧上下文，仅保留当前块内的信息，并丢弃此前各块的信息。这种截断通常能够维持较低的困惑度，但会丢失长程信息。为克服这一局限，引入块间注意力，以支持不同块之间的注意力计算，但其对远距离 token 位置的表征精度有所降低。最后，引入相邻块注意力，专门用于两个块相邻的情形，以保留局部性</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue04947a2" id="ue04947a2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790856577791-8e96b044-da89-4fea-b0c7-8a6735374cc9.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ud14e49c6-1b52-4388-aee3-0f6218f8baa%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9591ce18-2d77-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A702.6000366210938%2C%22height%22%3A244%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A328358%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1267%2C%22originHeight%22%3A440%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22(C)SUCCESSIVE-CHUNKATTENTIO%22%2C%22x%22%3A930%2C%22y%22%3A11%2C%22width%22%3A216%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%A6%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A843%2C%22y%22%3A51%2C%22width%22%3A17%2C%22height%22%3A206%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22987654%22%2C%22x%22%3A401%2C%22y%22%3A222%2C%22width%22%3A230%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(B)INTER-CHUNKATTENTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A517%2C%22y%22%3A11%2C%22width%22%3A182%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3APOSITIONIDSOFK%22%2C%22x%22%3A535%2C%22y%22%3A414%2C%22width%22%3A151%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3APOSITIONIDSOF%22%2C%22x%22%3A160%2C%22y%22%3A414%2C%22width%22%3A136%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A793%2C%22y%22%3A58%2C%22width%22%3A15%2C%22height%22%3A163%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3APOSITIONIDSOF%22%2C%22x%22%3A978%2C%22y%22%3A415%2C%22width%22%3A132%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RA-CHUNKATTENTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A182%2C%22y%22%3A11%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22987654%22%2C%22x%22%3A454%2C%22y%22%3A249%2C%22width%22%3A152%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CHUNK1CHUNK%22%2C%22x%22%3A499%2C%22y%22%3A35%2C%22width%22%3A204%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2234501%22%2C%22x%22%3A525%2C%22y%22%3A398%2C%22width%22%3A138%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A23%2C%22y%22%3A65%2C%22width%22%3A16%2C%22height%22%3A179%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(AINTRA-%22%2C%22x%22%3A140%2C%22y%22%3A12%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CHUNK2%22%2C%22x%22%3A242%2C%22y%22%3A34%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22JNTRA%22%2C%22x%22%3A867%2C%22y%22%3A33%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80CHUNKLNR%22%2C%22x%22%3A933%2C%22y%22%3A43%2C%22width%22%3A118%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CHUNK%22%2C%22x%22%3A121%2C%22y%22%3A35%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A792%2C%22y%22%3A161%2C%22width%22%3A14%2C%22height%22%3A101%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A914%2C%22y%22%3A93%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A76%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A887%2C%22y%22%3A75%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A118%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%A3%22%2C%22x%22%3A932%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A47%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223210%22%2C%22x%22%3A117%2C%22y%22%3A198%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e9e6e5%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u17ab7404%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u88343a78" id="u88343a78"><strong><span data-lake-id="u81e759e8" id="u81e759e8">块内注意力用于计算同一块内查询向量与键向量的内积</span></strong></p><ul list="u44177d09"><li fid="u54da2d1b" data-lake-id="u24c74f2c" id="u24c74f2c"><span data-lake-id="u271578eb" id="u271578eb">对于长度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6945e109777fe3fd777e8254f0ec0f0c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dmvit%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6abe6991" id="u6abe6991">的长序列，将其划分为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7Bl%7D%7Bs%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F420be35cbea8d4d1de76f8fbace5d931.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vyAYK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u470052a4" id="u470052a4">个块，从而确保每个块内的位置索引不超过块大小</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JLbwD%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u54da2d1b" data-lake-id="uab9bbced" id="uab9bbced"><span data-lake-id="u32b986d8" id="u32b986d8">展示将一个包含 12 个 token、超过预训练长度 10 的序列划分为两个块的过程，其中每个块包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%3D6%3C10%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff6c19baae5e8ff5394e009c7cc2e2d02.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wowle%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u908b7ff4" id="u908b7ff4"> 个 token。随后，键和查询的位置索引被限制在块大小 6 所对应的范围内。键的位置索引为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D%3D%5B%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B0%2C1%2C2%2C3%2C4%2C5%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bchunk%200%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B0%2C1%2C2%2C3%2C4%2C5%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bchunk%201%7D%7D%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F83511aff98edce735817d0a19688b79f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tgPYc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9c455006" id="u9c455006">，且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BIntra%7D%7D%3DP_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa04c8193f04e748414c5cd21d09e3579.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ajuYg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud8f2aa71" id="ud8f2aa71">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BIntra%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3ac2d071461aa62ef0737418f8de6e4e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YyClh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u40d23a49" id="u40d23a49">表示块内注意力中查询的位置索引。形式化地，在块内注意力中，按如下方式调整查询和键的位置索引</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u844820d1" id="u844820d1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BIntra%7D%7D%3DP_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D%3D%5B0%2C1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cl-1%5D%5C%5Cbmod%20s.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F950107b05e3a51cac209e6cc5be91180.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cwVzL%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u181ce410"><li fid="ucc7cb2ab" data-lake-id="u09811935" id="u09811935"><span data-lake-id="u5fa6184d" id="u5fa6184d">对于位于同一块内，即满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clfloor%20i%2Fs%5C%5Crfloor%3D%5C%5Clfloor%20j%2Fs%5C%5Crfloor%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f3e974dcd680bf0c0f4e3794dd0e5f6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QntFH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud85f676e" id="ud85f676e">，且满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%220%5C%5Cleq%20j%5C%5Cleq%20i%3Cl%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F59bb6cf82985e5d6940c19aad032a870.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZnL1P%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1d313878" id="u1d313878">的绝对位置索引</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jDcCs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7fe40452" id="u7fe40452">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22j%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F036441a335dd85c838f76d63a3db2363.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tMIY8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucbcd6ec5" id="ucbcd6ec5">，矩阵元素</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%5Bi%5D%5Bj%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbe5ceb0cce5e23dc4df3cbe2ad774af5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TCWvQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8cff2c60" id="u8cff2c60">定义为查询与键的位置编码之差</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9d1360b3" id="u9d1360b3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%5Bi%5D%5Bj%5D%3DP_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BIntra%7D%7D%5Bi%5D-P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D%5Bj%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F721a08303fb36cd01f64bd57ffc6c13d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dNwXV%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc2537148"><li fid="uf7fb8474" data-lake-id="u827db3f4" id="u827db3f4"><span data-lake-id="u2987850c" id="u2987850c">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clfloor%20i%2Fs%5C%5Crfloor%3D%5C%5Clfloor%20j%2Fs%5C%5Crfloor%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f3e974dcd680bf0c0f4e3794dd0e5f6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GkeOt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud277e35d" id="ud277e35d">时，按照公式（3）计算</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%5Bi%5D%5Bj%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbe5ceb0cce5e23dc4df3cbe2ad774af5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22U0x9C%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1aace95e" id="u1aace95e">。随后，第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UvM0n%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud6496420" id="ud6496420">个查询与第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22j%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F036441a335dd85c838f76d63a3db2363.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XHPLE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue5b2603e" id="ue5b2603e">个键之间的块内注意力分数计算如下</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7d406952" id="u7d406952" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_i%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_j%3Df(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%2CP_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BIntra%7D%7D%5Bi%5D)%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7Df(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%2CP_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D%5Bj%5D).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7976116a59e599ed1611bdb1aff4b128.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BQb9M%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u7636b5f3" id="u7636b5f3"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8ee39021" id="u8ee39021">为聚合其他块中的信息，引入块间注意力</span></strong></p><ul list="u4ceede2e"><li fid="u8007e1f9" data-lake-id="u5878511b" id="u5878511b"><span data-lake-id="u5514b76d" id="u5514b76d">在基于 Llama 的大语言模型中，查询的位置索引不小于其所关注的键的位置索引，以体现从左到右的信息流，即当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%5C%5Cgeq%20j%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7151c80d4b6df5840d5cbf002ed44556.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nRYxJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u60b35f1a" id="u60b35f1a">时，有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%5Bi%5D%5C%5Cgeq%20P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D%5Bj%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F57cbde92f76f3ea4f6b922093d71ee49.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fP94k%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u8007e1f9" data-lake-id="uf5a02ab7" id="uf5a02ab7"><span data-lake-id="u4246ff13" id="u4246ff13">若直接使用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%3DP_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BIntra%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3c4b2bd488b4aa39e662eb9e8f831933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ifqkV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uefe4ec63" id="uefe4ec63">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd9228d0391300a273195cf9e3e1d1547.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qpuyu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8e49cabd" id="u8e49cabd">计算不同块之间的注意力，显然会违反这一性质。考虑到 KV cache，保持键的位置索引</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd9228d0391300a273195cf9e3e1d1547.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yJV3o%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3b99cb30" id="u3b99cb30">不变，并为块间注意力寻找一组新的查询位置索引</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0237e84f1bdc4f75a92dcd3d69ed635a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lkuWr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5f54e309" id="u5f54e309">，记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Binter%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3a5896f36d4cbbaa5b5d1ca10aa676ec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RemYJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubd8f4a8a" id="ubd8f4a8a">。根据公式（2），键的位置索引循环重复，其最大位置索引为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmax(P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D)%3Ds-1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F80a872fb8b2797223b17a4990619d682.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jQYfu%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u8007e1f9" data-lake-id="ud2d22132" id="ud2d22132"><span data-lake-id="uf3481b34" id="uf3481b34">为确保查询的位置索引大于此前各块中所有键的位置索引，一种简单策略是为这些远距离查询分配足够大的位置索引，例如预训练阶段的最大位置索引 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c-1%3E%5C%5Cmax(P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd2251f1f9bc372fe08738a154599ba0e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hCGav%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud039381e" id="ud039381e">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb891664b42113aee13f0bac25eb998e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QYUNj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4b838bb8" id="u4b838bb8">表示预训练上下文长度</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u93a99da2" id="u93a99da2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BInter%7D%7D%3D%5B%5C%5Cunderbrace%7Bc-1%2Cc-1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cc-1%7D_%7Bl%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Belements%7D%7D%5D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F983de7ac346aea644bd1b1757ad064e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hJ8sB%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc3f99444"><li fid="u889ac12c" data-lake-id="u471ecba4" id="u471ecba4"><span data-lake-id="uebb640b1" id="uebb640b1">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clfloor%20i%2Fs%5C%5Crfloor%5C%5Cneq%5C%5Clfloor%20j%2Fs%5C%5Crfloor%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc2707b90cabffe5c3644c35a57e9fb76.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KNzql%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0e2007ff" id="u0e2007ff">时，对于来自不同块的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7118f09da8691f69f0943946df0fbbef.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ekaZT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufef09776" id="ufef09776">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_j%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F46bff9170d64ac2d3fefe9fad6e7d747.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vv7U3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1c5f4a75" id="u1c5f4a75">，相对位置矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5dde593f0bc27956e14b5eaec2ed17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c3exd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8d928236" id="u8d928236">的元素可表示为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0faff94c" id="u0faff94c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%5Bi%5D%5Bj%5D%3DP_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BIntra%7D%7D%5Bi%5D-P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D%5Bj%5D%3Dc-1-P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D%5Bj%5D%5C%5Cgeq%20c-s.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe350a0371901026028c2ad8f3a3299a9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rHEO5%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u3249b2bc" id="u3249b2bc"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud75c9f79" id="ud75c9f79">相邻块注意力可以视为块间注意力的一种特殊情形，其目的是保持 LLMs 的局部性。局部性是指 LLMs 在预测下一个 token 时往往高度依赖相邻 token。仅使用块间注意力可能无法保持相邻 token 之间精确的相对位置，从而导致性能下降</span></strong></p><ul list="u250868af"><li fid="u0f3dbd9d" data-lake-id="udeb29fb5" id="udeb29fb5"><span data-lake-id="ufeed8952" id="ufeed8952">这一问题仅出现在相邻块之间，因此引入新的相邻块注意力来处理这种情况。通过调整</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BInter%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21848bc25f265679c35bdcd708e4bd30.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PfBKF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9a5f8c4c" id="u9a5f8c4c">中每个块的前</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc9b08ae6d9fed72562880f75720531bc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z4pYt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u093c95e9" id="u093c95e9">个位置索引，保持</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc9b08ae6d9fed72562880f75720531bc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WizEu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ueba7febe" id="ueba7febe">个邻近 token 的局部性。给定预训练上下文长度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c%3D10%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa98409307cfca4be485be09098a2c1d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oKUUm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u82b57ab5" id="u82b57ab5">、块大小</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%3D6%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F05b3f7d6adb31902a6afeb29ec04f13a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22L6t97%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8201cf8b" id="u8201cf8b">，以及</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BInter%7D%7D%3D%5B%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B9%2C9%2C9%2C9%2C9%2C9%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bchunk%200%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B9%2C9%2C9%2C9%2C9%2C9%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bchunk%201%7D%7D%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F700c2e8dc6f6a57a411e382e54620101.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22T7bqf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8f24c9c4" id="u8f24c9c4">，若保持大小为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w%3D4%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5fe251797d41a2cfcb81b25726db60ab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rswmD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uda617f2e" id="uda617f2e"> 的局部窗口，则可将位置索引</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSucc%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1c73aa267fd23b0c29d90f5e40e54f38.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22o89Cn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue3273e26" id="ue3273e26">设为 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Ctextcolor%7Bblue%7D%7B6%2C7%2C8%2C9%7D%2C9%2C9%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bchunk%200%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Ctextcolor%7Bblue%7D%7B6%2C7%2C8%2C9%7D%2C9%2C9%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bchunk%201%7D%7D%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffa8b4a94654869f6cd106eb98b9692ec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XOxFw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u806f2701" id="u806f2701">，用于相邻块之间的注意力计算</span></li><li fid="u0f3dbd9d" data-lake-id="uc3ba610a" id="uc3ba610a"><span data-lake-id="u5aa83be4" id="u5aa83be4">形式化地，给定块大小</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nHiNC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udc15d0e5" id="udc15d0e5">、预训练长度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb891664b42113aee13f0bac25eb998e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mdU2N%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub05c2ed4" id="ub05c2ed4">和局部窗口大小</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc9b08ae6d9fed72562880f75720531bc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u3W1D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua6409958" id="ua6409958">，有</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8116c453" id="u8116c453" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSucc%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Coverbrace%7Bs%2Cs%2B1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cs%2Bw-1%7D%5E%7Bw%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Belements%7D%7D%2Cc-1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cc-1%5C%5Cright%5D%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bthe%20same%20for%20all%20chunks%7D%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdab02de89cf71969305d0d0bfe276f24.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OqmoB%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u5b6f0243"><li fid="u4be15f5b" data-lake-id="u4fdb492a" id="u4fdb492a"><span data-lake-id="u62e77947" id="u62e77947">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc9b08ae6d9fed72562880f75720531bc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22izZyI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u69800b65" id="u69800b65">表示局部窗口大小，可直接设为预训练长度与块大小之差</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c-s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F127c31c9af04b24996fe3363f3f246ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22otOpx%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf0070104" id="uf0070104"><strong><span data-lake-id="u426152d1" id="u426152d1" style="color: #DF2A3F">结合块内注意力、块间注意力和相邻块注意力，最终按如下方式计算</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%5Bi%5D%5Bj%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbe5ceb0cce5e23dc4df3cbe2ad774af5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K5Je1%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u9813f444" id="u9813f444" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%5Bi%5D%5Bj%5D%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5CnP_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BIntra%7D%7D%5Bi%5D-P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D%5Bj%5D%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%20%7D%5C%5Clfloor%20i%2Fs%5C%5Crfloor-%5C%5Clfloor%20j%2Fs%5C%5Crfloor%3D0%5C%5C%5C%5C%5CnP_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSucc%7D%7D%5Bi%5D-P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D%5Bj%5D%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%20%7D%5C%5Clfloor%20i%2Fs%5C%5Crfloor-%5C%5Clfloor%20j%2Fs%5C%5Crfloor%3D1%5C%5C%5C%5C%5CnP_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BInter%7D%7D%5Bi%5D-P_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D%5Bj%5D%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%20%7D%5C%5Clfloor%20i%2Fs%5C%5Crfloor-%5C%5Clfloor%20j%2Fs%5C%5Crfloor%3E1.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd7bbf601a017c087bed3c0c576a03455.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BtYbN%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud43323c7" id="ud43323c7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_i%5E%7BT%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_j%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cnf(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%2CP_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BIntra%7D%7D%5Bi%5D)%5E%7BT%7Df(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%2CP_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D%5Bj%5D)%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%20%7D%5C%5Clfloor%20i%2Fs%5C%5Crfloor-%5C%5Clfloor%20j%2Fs%5C%5Crfloor%3D0%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnf(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%2CP_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSucc%7D%7D%5Bi%5D)%5E%7BT%7Df(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%2CP_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D%5Bj%5D)%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%20%7D%5C%5Clfloor%20i%2Fs%5C%5Crfloor-%5C%5Clfloor%20j%2Fs%5C%5Crfloor%3D1%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnf(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%2CP_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BInter%7D%7D%5Bi%5D)%5E%7BT%7Df(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%2CP_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D%5Bj%5D)%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%20%7D%5C%5Clfloor%20i%2Fs%5C%5Crfloor-%5C%5Clfloor%20j%2Fs%5C%5Crfloor%3E1%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Feda20afb66f8b051abce8f090327d8cd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hqAhM%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf2a8bcd4" id="uf2a8bcd4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7157b733" id="u7157b733">Softmax 层：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1367d387" id="u1367d387">DCA 中的内积计算已在公式（8）中给出形式化定义。随后，使用 softmax 函数对计算得到的内积进行归一化</span></p><p data-lake-id="ube6d6ac1" id="ube6d6ac1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bp%7D_i%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsoftmax%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_i%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_0%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7Bd%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_i%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7Bd%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_i%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_i%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7Bd%7D%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B9%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9ed497aa615aaa21cf493e134ec82039.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pX3IO%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u243d13cd" id="u243d13cd" style="text-align: center"><br></p>